      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_43",
      "quote": "the selected categories reflect biologically plausible and clinically relevant dimensions of variability grounded in established pharmacologic principles.",
      "reason": "The manuscript provides a brief biological plausibility statement relating subgroup choices to pharmacologic principles, which partially addresses mechanism of action; however, no explicit description of the proposed mechanism of action of oral probiotics for acne is provided in the retrieved evidence."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
